7. Do not optimize strategies yet if the data/timestamp validation is not passing.

BEST NEXT DEVELOPMENT TARGET

The next version should be called something like:

Institutional_Quant_Research_Engine_V2.ipynb

It should consolidate the current notebook and add:
- unified point-in-time data schema
- automated walk-forward experimentation
- strategy discovery
