PHASE E — PAPER
1. End-to-end live signal generation.
2. Simulated next-open execution.
3. Latency/slippage tracking.
4. Data outage tests.
5. Drift monitoring.
6. Reconciliation.
7. Persistent safeguards.

Only after these phases should promotion beyond RESEARCH_ONLY be considered.

10. FINAL GO / NO-GO
====================

CURRENT ENGINE:
NO-GO for live trading.
NO-GO for strategy promotion.
GO for further research development.

CURRENT REAL SPY/QQQ BASELINE:
NO-GO as evidence of alpha.

SYNTHETIC RESULTS:
Useful for pipeline testing only; NOT market evidence.

THE MOST IMPORTANT NEXT STEP:
Do not add more indicators or more complex ML yet. First correct the causal execution/risk path and make discovery/research trials statistically accountable. Then rerun a clean real-data baseline from the current code version and only afterward begin controlled strategy discovery.
